## 6. Step-by-step walkthrough

Walk through my example one step at a time.

Explain exactly what happens.

Do not skip internal reasoning steps.

---

## 7. Enterprise design

Explain how companies typically implement this.

Discuss common design patterns.

Discuss trade-offs.

---

## 8. Common mistakes

Explain beginner mistakes.

Explain production mistakes.

Explain why they happen.

---

